{"server":"en","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-01_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-01","title":"Meeting","storyCode":"3-1","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6592a99b429f20bfae4bf5dc9eab138491b2e1363008eec0d3c5482809cc4f72","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Looks like you had a rough time as well."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en, what happened here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We were ambushed by Reunion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We were caught in a withering assault with no reinforcements. They easily routed our forces."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"And Misha...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"She was taken away by a woman dressed in red."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I really should have..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Nevermind."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en, why is Misha so special?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If you keep hiding things from us, it's only going to be harder and harder for us to continue working together."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I have no obligation to tell you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But Rhodes Island has an obligation to understand the objectives and prepare our strategies accordingly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Naturally, we'll continue to follow the L.G.D.'s instructions during our operations..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"However, when it comes to using the Infected to fight other Infected, we need all the information we can get."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"While you may have that information, you don't have the means of using it effectively to reduce your losses."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"On the other hand, we have the ability to stop Reunion, but we don't know what they're after."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"You sounded a bit like that doctor just now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Is, is that so..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I think..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"This is something that is equally important to both of us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I see."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If it's because you need to ask for permission from Chief Wei..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"When we investigated Misha, the most prominent bit of information was that her father was one of Chernobog's most influential people."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Misha's father?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Naturally, we don't know how much Misha knows about Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"She could know nothing, or she could know everything."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Nobody knows..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...except her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We also have no idea what kind of information she might have."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Since you predicted that Lungmen would be Reunion's next target..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It's obvious that we have to prevent Reunion from using Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"That's why we can't allow them to have Misha."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We were aware of the fact that someone who fit her descriptions had taken refuge in Lungmen..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"But until you actually found her, we weren't able to verify if that intel was accurate."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If that's the case, we can't waste any more time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to stop Reunion and rescue Misha before they're able to take her back to Chernobog!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island, prepare to move out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It was the L.G.D.'s responsibility to track her down."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...and letting Reunion capture her was a dereliction of our duties."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Rather than lauching a joint operation, we'll need Rhodes Island to eliminate other threats from Reunion."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"This is an order."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Understood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't let me down."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"N-no! D-don't beat me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"You should've thought twice before entering Lungmen!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaaagh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Lock them all up!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"They're not with this group of Infected. Curses..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Not with this group either... Damn it all..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"They... retreated way too quickly..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"It seems that Reunion also has its own hierarchy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"They just left the riffraff behind to buy them more time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"To think that a single person could delay our reinforcements..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Just who are they..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam! We found some Reunion stragglers over there!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Follow me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful, Madam Ch'en!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"It's an ambush!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":true,"text":"G-go to hell!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't get in my way--!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en, we're still on Lungmen soil!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"The nearby facilities can still be used, so please try not to cause too much damage!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Shut up already!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"At least, don't cut these buildings to pieces!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Th-this woman..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"She's so hard to deal with!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...Hard to deal with?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Foolish Infected..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Did you think we'd allow you filth to treat Lungmen like your personal latrine?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"L.G.D., attack!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["L.G.D. Agent"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]}]}
